sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Learner
  participant F as Fragment
  participant VM as base.c
  participant G as Grader (qm.i)
  U->>F: input / tap
  F->>VM: submit
  VM->>G: verdict(input, expected)
  Note over G: phase1 exact -> qm.e<br/>phase2 normalised -> qm.f<br/>else -> qm.g
  G-->>VM: CORRECT | CORRECT_NORMALISED | INCORRECT
  VM->>VM: H(tries, attempts)
